            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DoeThere"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Loved this Recipe! I had no yogurt on me at the time and used an entire fresh mango with a large banana and some juice and crushed ice. It was delicious and all the flavors worked together very well. Definitely fills your stomach!",
            "datePublished": "2012-01-04T20:52:29.803Z"
